Hello!

I’m modelling
shipment consolidation policies in simmer and I want to include a timeout
function based on the batch size to simulate the loading time of a truck. I am
able to do this for a quantity policy because the batch size is predetermined. However,
when modelling a time policy I want to use only the timeout option in the batch
function without batch size (batch(timeout=…)). Is there
a way to get the number of units in a batch and using this number in a timeout
function? The number of units in a batch (and thus the length of the timeout
function) would be different for every batch.

Thankyou in advance!

