Hi!

I was wondering if there is a way to get the total number of
batches released after a run is completed in order to use that number in further
calculations (fixed costs of a batch). Each batch number does show up in the
log after using log_() after batch(), but I can’t find
a way to implement those in the calculations I made from get_mon_arrivals(). Therefore
I was wondering if there is a function or workaround to get the total number of
batches after a run? Dividing the total arrivals with the batch size won’t work since I am using clones, which
are included in the batches but not in further calculations.

Thankyou in advance.

